  "prefLabel": "Bar 404.06 Pre-Hearing Conference",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 404.06 Pre-Hearing Conference. Prior to a hearing, the person the board is considering imposing a fine upon may request a meeting with a member of the board’s staff to discuss the matter. If a meeting is requested, it shall be the responsibility of the person the board is considering imposing a fine upon to contact the board office to schedule a mutually convenient appointment with the appropriate staff member.\n\nSource. #6577, eff 9-13-97 (formerly Bar 503.03); ss by #7323, eff 7-26-00; ss by #9221, INTERIM, eff 7-30-08; ss by #9345, eff 12-10-08; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15; ss by #12226, eff 6-30-17",
